+ * viewport it is drawn through, the same for about 97% of scene draws. The
+ * renderer's vertex output keeps clip x, y and w and maps z by the guest's
+ * viewport depth transform (vp_record_cb), so a scene pixel at host
+ * (ndc.x, ndc.y) with depth d is clip/w = (ndc.x, ndc.y, (d - vz1) / vz0, 1),
+ * and VP_prev * inverse(VP_now) takes it to last frame's clip position.
