+ * Per frame: every distinct C among the scene draws becomes an object with
+ * its view-projection; each viewport (main view, rear mirror) takes the one
+ * of its most-drawn object. Camera only: what moves in the world (cars) gets
+ * the camera's vector here; per-object vectors are step 3.
